<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd"
  identifier="isee-p3-anger1-abhorrent-yourturn" title="Your Turn: Abhorrent" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">

  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>C</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>

  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
          <qti-prompt>Which sentence uses abhorrent correctly?</qti-prompt>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">Commuters called the abhorrent detour on Route 9 a mild nuisance, forgotten by dinnertime.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="B">The abhorrent lecture was so dull that half the class dozed off.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">Voters found the senator's plan to profit from the disaster abhorrent.</qti-simple-choice>
          <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">She found her rival's abhorrent scarf simply not to her taste.</qti-simple-choice>
        </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="correct" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Spot on. A scheme to profit from others' suffering inspires real disgust — abhorrent condemns something morally repellent, and the voters are passing exactly that moral judgment.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="incorrect" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Abhorrent means inspiring real disgust and loathing. A detour shrugged off as a mild nuisance, a lecture that merely bores, and a scarf that is simply not to one's taste all fall far short of that -- annoyance, boredom, and personal preference are not revulsion. Profiting from a disaster is the one thing here that genuinely disgusts.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-A" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>This sentence calls the dessert abhorrent while telling us it was 'the most requested item' — diners keep ordering more. Something abhorrent repels; nobody lines up for seconds of what they loathe.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-B" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>An aroma that 'drew happy diners in from three blocks away' is downright irresistible. Abhorrent describes what drives crowds off in disgust — this soup's smell is earning the opposite reaction.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-D" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Cinematography the critics themselves call 'stunning' is being admired, not despised. Pairing that praise with abhorrent flips the word's force — abhorrent condemns, and admiration is the last response it describes.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>

  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE"/></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">correct</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incorrect</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">A</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-A</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">B</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-B</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">D</qti-base-value></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-D</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
